    {
      "name": "a-boundary-between-two-nodes-is-not-an-obstacle",
      "why": "An edge crossing a system boundary is normal, so a container must never push a route onto a different face. Without this the two sides can disagree: the SVG renderer excludes containers by semanticType, and the canvas only does so when EditorPage passes containerIds.",
